age development tools \u201cdev tools\u201d;  An interactive dashboard web application with \u201cShiny\u201d;  A JavaScript-based library for interactive plots with \u201cPlotly\u201d.  The project then deploys an R dashboard application with the framework for building and deploying Shiny apps, \u201cgolem\u201d; and other optional deployment  versions of the project with Docker.","topics":[],"score":247124,"global_rank":67793},{"name":"JosiahParry/intro-to-r","owner":"JosiahParry","html_url":"https://github.com/JosiahParry/intro-to-r","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":"Intro to R prepared for the Queensland Department of Treasury","topics":[],"score":247121,"global_rank":67797},{"name":"mws262/HelixAnimation","owner":"mws262","html_url":"https://github.com/mws262/HelixAnimation","stars":1,"forks":3,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Matlab","description":"MATLAB code to generate a helix animation with projections onto planes for sine/cosine. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2uESlFxGVDM","topics":[],"score":247120,"global_rank":67805},{"name":"andyscott/recursion-scheme-talk","owner":"andyscott","html_url":"https://github.com/andyscott/recursion-scheme-talk","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Scala","description":null,"topics":[],"score":247118,"global_rank":67807},{"name":"moromis/inpursuitofblue","owner":"moromis","html_url":"https://github.com/moromis/inpursuitofblue","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"SCSS","description":null,"topics":[],"score":247116,"global_rank":67810},{"name":"zicodeng/k8s-demo","owner":"zicodeng","html_url":"https://github.com/zicodeng/k8s-demo","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Makefile","description":"Learn how to set up local K8s cluster for testing and deploy app to AWS EKS for production.","topics":[],"score":247115,"global_rank":67812},{"name":"alexp-computematrix/packer-plugin-password","owner":"alexp-computematrix","html_url":"ht